1
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:17,129
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:36,639
Send my regards and respect
to the wise men of Turks.

3
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,759
As you order, Osman Bey.

4
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:55,879
Hold on, my Shahzade.

5
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:14,159
Whoever sets their eyes on what
is mine will bring their own deaths.

6
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:18,999
There is nothing which is yours.

7
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:30,159
You are talking to Amir Gorklu Khan!

8
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:36,159
Leave him! Leave!

9
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:44,719
I swear we will drive all
of you out of these lands!

10
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:50,839
Holofira, don't be afraid.

11
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:56,319
We’ll get out of here. We never bow.

12
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:02,159
My Shahzade, hold on! We will be saved!

13
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:08,919
Orhan!

14
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:18,199
Osman's baby! What you said will never happen!

15
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:26,439
If you weren't the bait,

16
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:31,279
...you wouldn't have lived this long.

17
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:43,559
Attention! Osman Bey!

18
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:53,079
-Peace be upon you!
-Peace be upon you too!

19
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:59,719
Alps! We got some intelligence last night.

20
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:05,159
And we sent messengers
to the lords in the borders.

21
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:06,719
"Boran.
My Bey.

22
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:10,199
-What's the situation?
-The messengers arrived, my Bey.

23
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:13,799
-The lords will be where you ordered.
-Well.

24
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:20,039
-I think the lords will play a trick, my Bey.
-They will. Absolutely, they will.

25
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:24,839
But we will play a bigger trick.

26
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:31,799
When you accomplish your
duties, the lords will have to obey us.

27
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:35,239
We won't be unprepared.

28
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:39,679
My Bey, what will happen when the lords obey?

29
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:44,119
What is a state?

30
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:50,479
If those under your command are only your people,

31
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:53,799
...you can grow bigger.

32
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:59,319
You can be a bey and then a beylic.

33
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:04,759
But if all of them are under your command

34
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,999
...if you see their people as your own people,

35
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:12,559
...if you collect taxes and protect them,

36
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:19,959
...then you can be a state
and then a state of world!

37
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:27,079
Both Seljuks and Mongolians did so.

38
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:30,959
-If Allah permits, we will do the same.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

39
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:34,759
My Bey, should we trust heathens?

40
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:40,599
Samil, how do you know heathens
will always remain heathens?

41
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:46,679
Who knows? Maybe, Allah
will warm their hearts up...

42
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:50,359
...and make them join Islam, the right way.

43
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,519
-If Allah permits my Bey.
-If Allah permits

44
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:56,679
But if they keep being treacherous,

45
00:06:56,840 --> 00:07:01,639
...I won't avoid beheading
them. You should know that.

46
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:06,239
Keep your hearts at ease!
For sure...

47
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:09,479
..we will be victorious.

48
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:15,599
Osman's dynasty will be victorious!
Osmanli Beylic will be victorious!

49
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:22,439
Osmanli Beylic! Osmanli Beylic!

50
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:29,319
We'll go meet the lords with Boran and the alps.

51
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:36,159
Konur, you will take action.
Sisters will be with you.

52
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:40,399
Your duty will be tough. But remember.

53
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:43,799
If you can't finish the duty on time,

54
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:47,319
...then our plan will fail.

55
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:54,199
Don't be worrying, my Bey. There will be a
battle. We will make the lords fight Mongolians.

56
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,759
Thank you.

57
00:07:57,040 --> 00:08:02,199
-Come on then! Everybody get to their duties!
-Yes, my Bey!

58
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:12,519
My Bey, what about Orhan Bey?

59
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:18,319
Turks can be taken prisoners
but never remain prisoners.

60
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:23,599
-Sure, my Bey.
-Come on, alps.

61
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:33,279
Hold on until Osman arrives.
When your father comes,

62
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:36,519
...your blood will flow on the ground together.

63
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:42,599
It's not that easy.

64
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:47,159
It is not that easy.

65
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:06,639
Nokers, chain this baby.

66
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:10,399
Apparently, he wants to move.

67
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:26,599
You won't be able to get out of this hell, baby.

68
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:31,919
You will burn to ashes here.

69
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:56,519
Don't look at me like that. I'm good.

70
00:09:57,560 --> 00:10:01,799
This is because of me. All because of me.

71
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:06,679
-You shouldn't have come alone, Orhan.
-I go...

72
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:10,999
...wherever you go Lord's daughter.

73
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:16,839
If we die, we die together
and we live together if we live.

74
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:24,119
If we die, we die together
and we live together if we live.

75
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:05,159
Come on, alps. Come on.

76
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:08,639
-Are the swords ready?
-Everything is ready, my Bey.

77
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,719
-Thank you. Aykurt!
-My Bey.

78
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:13,559
Increase the numbers of
patrols in the headquarters.

79
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,879
As you order, my Bey.

80
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:19,679
-Did the tricksters get informed?
-Yes. They'll be here, my Bey.

81
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:25,079
Alright then. Come on, warriors!
Get on horses! Time is limited!

82
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,799
-Come on.
-As you order, my Bey.

83
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,839
As you order, my Bey.

84
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:40,399
They will be here.

85
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:52,999
You stay here. We go after them. Come on.

86
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,839
Tell me. What bothers your mind?

87
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:29,279
Why are we doing this, my Bey?

88
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:37,439
Our other moves aren't enough
to overwhelm Gorklu Khan.

89
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:42,239
Not enough for now. Then...

90
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:47,239
...we will change the way.

91
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:53,079
If he is making a bigger move,

92
00:12:53,360 --> 00:13:00,159
...then we will make a bigger fight!
Who makes the fight bigger doesn't matter!

93
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:06,159
But we will win the fight. And I won't
leave Holofira and Orhan to them.

94
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:10,119
My Bey, will we trust them?

95
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:14,159
It's too late to think about it.
This is fight of life and death.

96
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:19,639
We'll always keep our eyes on them. If
they betray, we'll take their everything.

97
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:25,199
Well, my Bey... Will they trust us?

98
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:31,319
They will.

99
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:38,279
They'll have nothing else to do.
They will have nothing else to do.

100
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:44,399
Come on!

101
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:50,679
Osman Bey's success depends on our success.

102
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:56,319
Byzantine caravan is just a little ahead.
They're having a short rest in Karasu.

103
00:13:56,400 --> 00:14:00,999
We'll go there. They won't send us back.

104
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:08,839
Konur Bey, they're coming.

105
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:31,759
-This hatun?
-Daughter of Leo, one of Christian merchants.

106
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:34,239
She'll be with us in this action.

107
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:38,719
Okay. Mongolians must be
about to arrive. Stand on alert.

108
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:42,239
-Okay, Konur Bey.
-Come on.

109
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:55,799
Come here. Osman Bey made a good trick for you.

110
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:09,599
-Why did Osman want to meet us?
-Don't be afraid, Lord Valentin.

111
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:14,639
My army is waiting at the food of Kizildag.
The soldiers are prepared for anything.

112
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:18,119
We can destroy him here.

113
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:26,199
Osman's lineage will vanish here.

114
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:30,079
He must be about to arrive!

115
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:34,039
Nokers, come on!

116
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:39,399
Flare up the flames of hell!

117
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:56,079
Commander, scouts brought
news. They saw the princess.

118
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:03,879
Konur Bey, one of Osman's
beys, and his alps are with them.

119
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:09,719
They are moving towards Karasu.
They are disguised as crusaders.

120
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:17,439
That dog Konur. They're setting up trickery.

121
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:21,319
-How do you know this Karacelasun?
-Emir Gorklu Khan.

122
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:24,239
Byzantine is setting up a camp towards Karasu.

123
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:28,559
It seems they're hiding the princess in disguise.

124
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:31,879
That is why we couldn't find them all this time.

125
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:36,079
There is only one thing that
needs to be done, Karacelasun.

126
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:39,479
Even if they're disguised as crusaders..

127
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:43,399
..the spilled blood will be Turks'.

128
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:47,519
Go strike them! Tear them apart.

129
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:51,319
Bring the princess to me.

130
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:56,479
Osman. So you're playing tricks.

131
00:16:56,880 --> 00:17:01,159
To you and those behind you..

132
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:05,759
I will bring them Hadhrat Emir.

133
00:17:05,839 --> 00:17:09,919
If you don't bring them,
do not bother coming back.

134
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:16,279
Nokers! Come on, we leave now!

135
00:17:21,358 --> 00:17:22,719
Tong Chu.

136
00:17:24,358 --> 00:17:27,239
Prepare the horses.

137
00:17:27,358 --> 00:17:30,519
We will go elsewhere.

138
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:48,919
Are you hurt badly?

139
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:53,399
All this pain will go away..

140
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:58,079
..the moment you smile at me, Holofira.

141
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:12,079
However, do not worry.
We will get out of this place.

142
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:16,439
What? How, Orhan?

143
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:23,679
This is hell. They are too many, can't you see?

144
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:30,719
I will find a way.

145
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:42,159
They're coming!

146
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:03,799
I thought you called us here
to hand the princess over.

147
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:07,599
-I don't see the princess.
-I won't give her to you.

148
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:12,679
Did you lure us into an ambush, Osman Bey?

149
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:20,279
An ambush?

150
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:26,839
If I wanted harm for you..

151
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:31,879
-..I would give the princess to Mongols.
-Osman Bey, know this well.

152
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:38,079
My army is waiting near our location.
Do not try to play any tricks.

153
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:42,999
So your army is nearby.

154
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:48,239
Are you threatening me?

155
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:24,319
I came here to talk to you. Not to strike you..

156
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:28,159
..not to kill you.

157
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:32,839
First, take these. Boran.

158
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:03,479
What is this?

159
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:09,639
These are plans to take our forts.

160
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:13,839
-How can this be?
-The Emperor sold you out.

161
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:19,759
He is promising not only
the princess to mongols..

162
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:23,199
..but also your forts.

163
00:21:23,800 --> 00:21:26,759
You got out of the frying
pan right into the fire.

164
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:29,639
However, you are still not aware of it.

165
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:32,799
I won’t hand over my fort
and my family to mongols!

166
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:36,399
The Emperor already did, not me.

167
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:39,639
Are you hoping to deceive
us with these false documents?

168
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:42,919
The Emperor would never sell us out!

169
00:21:43,320 --> 00:21:47,159
I've heard there is not even a
single bey of Turks left behind you.

170
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:51,639
Everyone turned their backs
to you. You are hoping to..

171
00:21:51,840 --> 00:21:55,279
..pull your enemy to your side as a last resort.

172
00:21:55,520 --> 00:21:59,239
I won't show mercy to that kind of Osman!

173
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:33,719
-Osman!
-Lord!

174
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:39,239
I said I came here to talk.

175
00:22:41,120 --> 00:22:44,999
However, you are trying to get yourself killed.

176
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:48,359
Do not test my patience.

177
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:59,919
We have one shot at this. No room for mistakes.

178
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:06,599
When mongols are in position, you
will ride your horses to byzantians.

179
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:12,879
Do not forget, we only have one purpose.
Making Byzantine and Mongols fight each other.

180
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:15,559
-Okay.
-Come on.

181
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:38,919
-Where is the princess?
-With crusader-disguised alps.

182
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:45,839
-What about our scouts?
-They are after them, commander.

183
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:49,599
Osman!

184
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:55,359
Commander, they are on the move that way!

185
00:23:55,560 --> 00:24:00,119
My nokers, come on!

186
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:38,319
We will attack as soon as
the mongol enters the camp.

187
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:43,399
When Karacelasun see us, he will
be sure the crusaders side with us.

188
00:24:43,520 --> 00:24:48,839
Come on alps, to horses. Quickly.

189
00:24:56,880 --> 00:25:01,799
“Soldiers, defensive positions!
-Come on!

190
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:11,119
Mongols are after us!

191
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:15,479
Commander, mongols are after us. Help us!

192
00:25:15,560 --> 00:25:19,319
Protect those who are with us, soldiers!

193
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:22,399
Come on!

194
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:32,999
Where is the princess? Bring me the princess!

195
00:25:33,080 --> 00:25:37,239
Nokers, have their heads!

196
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:47,119
Soldier, inform the Lord that
mongols have ambushed us!

197
00:25:58,480 --> 00:26:04,319
The Lord will know mongols as
their enemy and Osman Bey as ally.

198
00:26:27,120 --> 00:26:30,119
-Did soldiers send a word?
-They flew a pigeon.

199
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:33,239
-It will arrive soon, If Allah permits.
-Okay.

200
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:36,159
Come on.

201
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:46,479
Now, they planned their
every move to have your forts..

202
00:26:46,600 --> 00:26:51,159
..your castles after defeating us.

203
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:55,799
And you are still here
swinging your swords at me.

204
00:26:56,520 --> 00:27:00,959
You will either walk with me..

205
00:27:01,040 --> 00:27:06,759
..or we will all see what
happens to you after us.

206
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:11,359
You do not have any other choice.

207
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:15,919
You too, Lord.

208
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:21,279
Those documents, those markings are all real.

209
00:27:22,160 --> 00:27:26,399
Take them, you ask about them.

210
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:30,079
You do not have to answe quickly as well.

211
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:35,959
However, you Lord. This is my last warning.

212
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:40,519
Do not make any mistakes again.

213
00:27:41,520 --> 00:27:48,999
Do not forget this. I am not
the hopeless one here, it is you.

214
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:56,879
-Sir, the troops has sent word.
-Say it!

215
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:59,119
“Mongols have attacked.
-Who attacked?

216
00:27:59,120 --> 00:28:02,559
Karacelasun, the commander of Gorklu Khan.

217
00:28:03,840 --> 00:28:07,479
-So they started now!
-Osman Bey speaks the truth.

218
00:28:07,600 --> 00:28:12,279
You are telling us the mongols
will attack, and they immediately do.

219
00:28:12,360 --> 00:28:16,999
-How can we believe this, Osman Bey?
-Do you think..

220
00:28:17,080 --> 00:28:20,279
..I would cooperate with Karacelasun..

221
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:25,399
..who has been attacking
me and my people for so long?

222
00:28:34,280 --> 00:28:37,679
You dog Konur.

223
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:40,999
-You lived long.
-Is that so?

224
00:28:41,080 --> 00:28:43,239
I've been thinking the same about you.

225
00:29:30,840 --> 00:29:34,599
Commander, we are losing!

226
00:29:52,520 --> 00:29:56,279
Tomorrow or sooner, I will have your lives!

227
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:59,959
Death is our ultimate union.
You think about yourself.

228
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:05,439
My nokers, we will fall back. Come on!

229
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:11,279
The only thing you know is
running away, you degenerate dog.

230
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:13,439
Soldier!

231
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:18,439
-Where are the ones who took shelter?
-They're gone, sir.

232
00:30:18,440 --> 00:30:22,479
-Was the Lord informed?
-Yes, sir.

233
00:30:28,640 --> 00:30:33,359
Now tell me Turk. Why did you help us?

234
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:36,959
You will learn that from your Lord, Commander.

235
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:43,599
Ilkhanids and Byzantium made an agreement.
And they will make you pay for this.

236
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:49,559
You will either listen to me...

237
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:52,759
...or I will leave you to your fate.

238
00:30:53,600 --> 00:30:56,359
Soldiers!

239
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:04,959
Alright, Osman Bey. What do you want from us?

240
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:13,639
Unity, loyalty and tax.

241
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:17,919
-What tax Osman Bey?
-From now on, you will give me the same taxes...

242
00:31:18,040 --> 00:31:22,359
...that you gave to the Seljuks...

243
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:25,079
...and the Ilkhanate.

244
00:31:25,200 --> 00:31:26,415
-Who do you think...

245
00:31:26,427 --> 00:31:29,759
I am the state which
protects you from the furor of...

246
00:31:30,080 --> 00:31:32,919
...Mongols.

247
00:31:35,160 --> 00:31:40,719
I resisted all the oppression
coming from the East.

248
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:44,759
From now on..

249
00:31:45,520 --> 00:31:48,679
...you will show us the same respect...

250
00:31:48,880 --> 00:31:52,879
...you showed to Byzantium and Ilkhanids.

251
00:31:55,040 --> 00:32:01,959
And I will protect your people,
like I protected them until this day.

252
00:32:02,240 --> 00:32:07,839
Make your decision now. But remember...

253
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:11,799
...Byzantium turned away from you.

254
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:16,159
If you still want to exist the state of Turks...

255
00:32:16,320 --> 00:32:19,959
...will protect you.

256
00:32:22,800 --> 00:32:29,039
I will be waiting for those who choose
us to join my table in Yenisehir tonight.

257
00:32:31,120 --> 00:32:32,479
Safely.

258
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:10,839
Alps are ready and waiting at the exit
of Yenisehir. They are waiting for orders.

259
00:33:10,840 --> 00:33:12,919
Let's leave before we lose any more time.

260
00:33:12,920 --> 00:33:16,279
We will save Orhan and Holofira from Mongols.

261
00:33:16,360 --> 00:33:19,559
Malhun Hatun! Bala Hatun!

262
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:24,279
We received news from our watchmen.
Saadet Hatun is coming to Yenisehir!

263
00:33:24,360 --> 00:33:25,719
It's not the right time!

264
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:28,839
We know what Saadet's
intention is. It is to cause problems.

265
00:33:28,840 --> 00:33:30,759
Malhun. Take care of Saadet.

266
00:33:30,760 --> 00:33:32,799
She is coming here to cause problems.

267
00:33:32,840 --> 00:33:34,839
No Bala! Orhan is in danger!

268
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:38,519
Mother! Mother! Bala mother!

269
00:33:39,440 --> 00:33:41,559
-I will come with you.
-Fatma!

270
00:33:41,720 --> 00:33:44,439
Not now! -Mother! No..

271
00:33:44,520 --> 00:33:46,799
I cannot wait here when my brother is there.

272
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:50,319
It is time. Let me go.

273
00:33:51,400 --> 00:33:53,919
Don't worry. You can deal with her.

274
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:57,679
Don't worry, we will take
Orhan and Holofira safely.

275
00:33:58,400 --> 00:34:02,719
Saadet must not hear about Orhan and Holofira.

276
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:06,079
-Don't forget informing me.
-Don't worry.

277
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:09,158
The children are entrusted to you.

278
00:34:09,239 --> 00:34:11,638
Be careful. -Come, Fatma.

279
00:34:11,719 --> 00:34:15,559
Come on. -Let's not lose time!
Come on!

280
00:34:16,880 --> 00:34:20,319
Come on, Alps! Sisters...

281
00:34:20,440 --> 00:34:23,279
May Allah help you. -Come on!

282
00:34:35,440 --> 00:34:38,438
May Allah protect you.

283
00:34:49,159 --> 00:34:53,319
Nokers! It is time to eat!

284
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:23,519
Holofira... When I give you the sign...

285
00:35:23,640 --> 00:35:29,079
..you will call the archer noker to your side.
-How will you get rid of those chains?

286
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:40,399
There is a way.

287
00:36:07,680 --> 00:36:11,759
Orhan, what did you do?

288
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:17,159
Come on... Now.

289
00:36:18,600 --> 00:36:21,439
Noker!

290
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:26,599
We are a bit hungry.

291
00:36:27,640 --> 00:36:32,119
-Some water and bread.
-Hunger is hard, huh?

292
00:36:33,160 --> 00:36:36,839
Good, good... Good.

293
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:21,319
Emir Hadhrat does not want you to die.

294
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:28,559
Here, eat. You must be hungry.

295
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:56,479
Holofira. Lower your head.

296
00:38:39,720 --> 00:38:42,359
Come.

297
00:39:02,440 --> 00:39:05,359
Come on! Run!

298
00:39:33,200 --> 00:39:35,399
Have you heard about Cerkutay?

299
00:39:35,480 --> 00:39:39,519
Did he admit that he was a spy?
-No, Saadet Hatun...

300
00:39:39,600 --> 00:39:42,519
-Someone will hear it.
-No they won't.

301
00:39:42,640 --> 00:39:45,839
No one will hear if I don't want them to hear.

302
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:48,039
Now..

303
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:52,879
You will do as I say, Ulgen.

304
00:39:54,120 --> 00:39:58,799
-That Princess...
-Will you use me now?

305
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:03,399
You want Cerkutay to die.

306
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:07,479
You want Ghazi to grow up without a father.

307
00:40:09,520 --> 00:40:13,159
What happened, Saadet Hatun?

308
00:40:13,320 --> 00:40:15,159
Why did you come?

309
00:40:15,240 --> 00:40:20,239
We missed Ghazi. We came here to ask Ulgen
to bring him to the frontiers' marketplace.

310
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:22,919
Did you come all that way to say this?

311
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:25,479
No. I have come to question you...

312
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:31,439
...for blocking the way to our marketplace
and dissuading the merchants who came to us.

313
00:40:31,560 --> 00:40:35,159
We are the ones who can
question others here, Saadet Hatun.

314
00:40:35,160 --> 00:40:38,719
Those merchants and the goods
belong to us! Any other questions?

315
00:40:38,720 --> 00:40:41,519
That's what suits you. Banditry.

316
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:44,759
But we always teach bandits where to stop.

317
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:47,079
Saadet Hatun..

318
00:40:47,160 --> 00:40:51,679
You better leave when you are still alive.

319
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:52,919
Or else I will..

320
00:40:53,040 --> 00:40:56,999
Those meaningless threats do not scare me.

321
00:40:57,280 --> 00:41:01,839
If you make our merchants go back again...

322
00:41:02,080 --> 00:41:05,239
...we will do what we need to do.

323
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:09,639
And this is my last word to you.

324
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:28,879
We haven't said our last words yet, Saadet.

325
00:41:42,200 --> 00:41:46,519
Are we going to switch places every day?

326
00:41:46,960 --> 00:41:51,359
We'll do so for a while, Princess.

327
00:41:53,720 --> 00:41:58,279
You're so afraid, right? Switch
places as much as you want.

328
00:41:58,400 --> 00:42:03,399
They will find you and you will be punished.

329
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:10,879
It's not out of fear, it's
just a precaution, Princess.

330
00:42:11,280 --> 00:42:15,159
My Shahzade, we were a little wait

331
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:18,679
not to leave any traces, forgive us.

332
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:24,079
No problem, Bayindir Bey. I
came early to take a look around.

333
00:42:26,040 --> 00:42:32,039
-Welcome, Princess.
-Am I going to stay here, Shahzade?

334
00:42:33,240 --> 00:42:36,519
It’s not worthy of you, of course.

335
00:42:36,920 --> 00:42:39,719
Forgive us. But,

336
00:42:39,920 --> 00:42:42,439
we put everything you might need inside.

337
00:42:42,680 --> 00:42:47,119
I will not stay long. They
will find me soon, after all.

338
00:42:47,320 --> 00:42:53,399
No. You'll be our guest for a long time.

339
00:42:57,160 --> 00:43:00,359
Princess.

340
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:25,959
The disgraces of Gok Tengri.

341
00:43:26,240 --> 00:43:29,839
If you cannot find

342
00:43:29,920 --> 00:43:33,079
that puppy's woman

343
00:43:33,280 --> 00:43:39,959
I'll burn this place down!

344
00:43:41,040 --> 00:43:46,039
We have sent our nokers all
around Hadhrat Emir. They'll find her.

345
00:43:46,960 --> 00:43:50,839
If you don't bring her...

346
00:44:03,960 --> 00:44:10,559
Where is the Princess Karacelasun?

347
00:44:16,160 --> 00:44:20,519
You embarrassed us, Karacelasun.

348
00:44:20,600 --> 00:44:24,679
Where is my Princess?

349
00:44:25,720 --> 00:44:31,759
We were trapped, Hadhrat
Emir. Osman is after bigger plans.

350
00:44:34,840 --> 00:44:40,719
I told you not to come to me
if you don't bring the Princess.

351
00:44:49,320 --> 00:44:53,359
Cut my head, Hadhrat Emir.

352
00:45:10,040 --> 00:45:15,999
Who are you to decide when your head will be cut?

353
00:45:16,320 --> 00:45:20,199
You will live as long as I want you to.

354
00:45:20,320 --> 00:45:24,399
Now, let's go.

355
00:45:26,640 --> 00:45:34,159
I want all the information
about Osman when I come back.

356
00:45:34,560 --> 00:45:38,359
Get the horses ready.

357
00:45:38,560 --> 00:45:45,119
We will go to Yakup Bey. I'll deal with it.

358
00:46:18,920 --> 00:46:21,519
Cerkutay.

359
00:46:21,600 --> 00:46:25,359
You can go and track her down

360
00:46:25,440 --> 00:46:28,759
or find out from Osman's palace.

361
00:46:28,760 --> 00:46:35,079
-You will find that Princess.
-Let’s see if you're really with us.

362
00:46:36,440 --> 00:46:42,119
Which way did you go, Bayindir Bey.

363
00:47:03,160 --> 00:47:07,639
You think you can hide traces from me?

364
00:47:22,240 --> 00:47:27,039
These traces are lighter,
it belongs to the Princess.

365
00:47:30,920 --> 00:47:36,879
You can't handle my scouting, Bayindir Bey.

366
00:47:43,000 --> 00:47:45,519
Maybe Osman Bey still doesn't trust Cerkutay?

367
00:47:45,640 --> 00:47:48,479
Would you trust him if you were him?

368
00:47:49,160 --> 00:47:56,679
If someone betrays once, he does it
again. No one deserves a second chance.

369
00:47:58,280 --> 00:48:01,559
Come on, Gonca.

370
00:48:04,360 --> 00:48:09,639
If someone betrays once,
he does it again. Is that so?

371
00:48:14,800 --> 00:48:17,319
Come on.

372
00:48:27,680 --> 00:48:29,999
Your hand does not seem well, we need to stop.

373
00:48:30,080 --> 00:48:31,919
-I'm all right Holofira, come on.
-No!

374
00:48:32,160 --> 00:48:34,519
First we will deal with your hand.

375
00:48:35,440 --> 00:48:39,599
You think about me too much daughter of the Lord.

376
00:48:44,120 --> 00:48:47,679
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

377
00:48:52,960 --> 00:48:55,519
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

378
00:49:12,960 --> 00:49:16,199
It was my fault, why did
I think about you at all?

379
00:49:16,320 --> 00:49:21,759
There's no need to talk about
why, Holofira. We're in love, after all.

380
00:49:30,400 --> 00:49:34,519
Take cover behind the trees!

381
00:49:43,760 --> 00:49:47,999
-Are you all right?
-I'm all right my Shahzade.

382
00:49:52,840 --> 00:49:58,359
-Surrender, Orhan.
-We will not surrender to these dastards.

383
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:04,319
-You have nowhere else to go.
-We will never give up!

384
00:50:04,440 --> 00:50:07,639
Let all of them come.

385
00:50:11,320 --> 00:50:14,399
Holofira.

386
00:51:07,320 --> 00:51:11,079
Orhan, stop!

387
00:51:19,400 --> 00:51:21,359
Hatun will die if you don't surrender.

388
00:51:21,480 --> 00:51:25,839
Never! Do not touch her!

389
00:51:26,320 --> 00:51:31,599
We will not go to Gorklu Khan
before we capture you. Do not resist.

390
00:51:39,880 --> 00:51:45,199
All right! All right, let her go.

391
00:52:07,160 --> 00:52:11,519
We have arrived, son. We have arrived.

392
00:52:16,680 --> 00:52:19,559
Are you all right?
Are you all right?

393
00:52:19,880 --> 00:52:23,159
-We're all right.
-We're all right Bala Ana.

394
00:52:23,560 --> 00:52:27,079
-You don't have any wounds, right?
-Nothing important.

395
00:52:27,160 --> 00:52:29,719
You arrived right on time.

396
00:52:32,480 --> 00:52:36,519
-I was so afraid, brother.
-Sister.

397
00:52:36,800 --> 00:52:40,519
Sister, you couldn't help yourself
and came after me, is that so?

398
00:52:43,720 --> 00:52:47,039
She'll be a strong sister.

399
00:52:47,760 --> 00:52:51,079
You will need to protect
yourself well during the training.

400
00:52:51,160 --> 00:52:55,119
We'll see. We'll see.

401
00:52:57,720 --> 00:53:04,079
Come on. We will ride our horses to
the place we decided with my Osman Bey.

402
00:53:05,760 --> 00:53:09,359
Osman Bey.

403
00:53:39,680 --> 00:53:44,879
-Peace be upon you, Yunus Emre.
-Peace be upon you too, Osman Bey.

404
00:53:46,040 --> 00:53:49,999
You are coming from clearing
the thorn on your way, huh?

405
00:53:50,880 --> 00:53:57,839
Yes. But thanks to Allah He let me see you here.

406
00:53:58,840 --> 00:54:01,679
Join me.

407
00:54:03,440 --> 00:54:05,519
I made soup. Drink some.

408
00:54:06,480 --> 00:54:11,479
I can't turn down your soup and words. Thank you.

409
00:54:15,480 --> 00:54:19,599
Heathens will make many plans.

410
00:54:19,920 --> 00:54:24,359
Believer will trust the Best of Planners...

411
00:54:24,560 --> 00:54:27,279
...and ruin those plans.

412
00:54:28,520 --> 00:54:31,799
Just like the Messenger of
Allah (PBUH) and his companions.

413
00:54:32,200 --> 00:54:37,439
They performed an assassination
against our Prophet (PBUH)...

414
00:54:37,760 --> 00:54:41,959
...but when they arrived in there,
they found Hadhrat Ali (R.A.) instead.

415
00:54:42,760 --> 00:54:46,679
Their plan failed.

416
00:54:46,840 --> 00:54:49,119
In the Treaty of al-Hudaybiya, they said...

417
00:54:49,160 --> 00:54:53,919
..."if anyone comes to Medina from
Mecca, you will send them back."

418
00:54:54,040 --> 00:55:00,879
"But we will accept those who leave Islam and
come back to the religion of their ancestors."

419
00:55:01,240 --> 00:55:05,839
Our Prophet (PBUH) accepted
these terms seeming disadvantageous.

420
00:55:05,880 --> 00:55:09,919
And the number of Muslims in
Mecca increased thanks to that.

421
00:55:10,120 --> 00:55:13,119
Actually, the conquest of Mecca...

422
00:55:13,120 --> 00:55:16,599
...got started with this treaty.

423
00:55:21,280 --> 00:55:24,319
Well, Osman Bey...

424
00:55:25,240 --> 00:55:29,839
You have a way to go and a guide.

425
00:55:30,640 --> 00:55:34,599
Although the names of heathens change,

426
00:55:34,720 --> 00:55:37,439
...their hostility remains the same.

427
00:55:37,480 --> 00:55:38,999
Yes.

428
00:55:39,480 --> 00:55:44,399
As long as you walk on the right way...

429
00:55:44,800 --> 00:55:48,119
...and holds the rope of Allah tightly,

430
00:55:48,320 --> 00:55:50,759
...you will always be victorious.

431
00:55:50,960 --> 00:55:54,639
And you will ruin all their plans one by one.

432
00:55:54,920 --> 00:55:56,959
For sure, for sure.

433
00:55:57,280 --> 00:55:59,239
I hope so.

434
00:56:04,600 --> 00:56:06,799
Thank you, Yunus Emre.

435
00:56:07,040 --> 00:56:11,519
Thank you. If Allah permits, it will be as you say.

436
00:56:13,240 --> 00:56:16,319
Well, you've filled our bag again.

437
00:56:17,440 --> 00:56:21,319
Now we should go.

438
00:56:21,880 --> 00:56:25,599
But we always expect to see you in Yenisehir.

439
00:56:25,680 --> 00:56:28,759
Be my guest. You will be treated properly.

440
00:56:29,040 --> 00:56:33,159
If Allah permits, Osman Bey. I will try to come.

441
00:56:35,160 --> 00:56:38,719
Well... Have a safe journey.

442
00:56:41,800 --> 00:56:43,119
Thank you.

443
00:57:44,840 --> 00:57:50,559
-Alps, peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

444
00:58:00,800 --> 00:58:03,599
Cerkutay.

445
00:58:05,400 --> 00:58:08,639
I knew you would come here.

446
00:58:10,840 --> 00:58:12,959
Hasan.

447
00:58:13,680 --> 00:58:18,239
I'm Cerkutay. Don't you recognize me?

448
00:58:19,320 --> 00:58:23,159
Shahzade Alaaddin's orders.
Nobody will pass.

449
00:58:23,360 --> 00:58:26,519
Stay back. Let me inform him.

450
00:58:36,680 --> 00:58:41,919
You don't know me, Hasan. If I want to go in,

451
00:58:42,560 --> 00:58:45,839
...I go in.

452
00:58:51,880 --> 00:58:53,839
What's going on here?

453
00:58:54,120 --> 00:58:58,559
-My Shahzade. -Alaaddin.

454
00:58:59,200 --> 00:59:02,479
Put your swords down. -Look at that.

455
00:59:03,280 --> 00:59:06,199
Impertinent Alaaddin.

456
00:59:09,680 --> 00:59:13,639
You will die too. Just be patient.

457
00:59:15,640 --> 00:59:18,999
What are you doing here, Cerkutay Bey?

458
00:59:19,360 --> 00:59:23,599
-Cerkutay, don't.
-Bayindir Bey.

459
00:59:24,640 --> 00:59:27,239
My Shahzade.

460
00:59:38,560 --> 00:59:44,199
-Speak.
-I have information for you.

461
00:59:45,920 --> 00:59:49,239
Yakup Bey is after the princess.

462
00:59:51,280 --> 00:59:55,119
He has sent good trackers around.

463
00:59:55,200 --> 00:59:58,519
I found first and brought the news to you.

464
01:00:01,120 --> 01:00:04,599
You need to change location.

465
01:00:13,520 --> 01:00:19,279
Did they realize? Brother, they look worried.

466
01:00:20,840 --> 01:00:23,359
Will we really trust Cerkutay?

467
01:00:23,480 --> 01:00:26,319
We trust nobody, sister.

468
01:00:26,520 --> 01:00:30,319
We'll follow and jump on them.

469
01:00:30,880 --> 01:00:35,039
Cerkutay was the scouting dog. He did his duty.

470
01:00:36,360 --> 01:00:40,519
Now we will see if the princess is here.

471
01:00:42,080 --> 01:00:45,079
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

472
01:00:45,320 --> 01:00:48,919
This is the second time you
are an uninvited guest, Amir.

473
01:00:49,320 --> 01:00:53,319
If don't wait for the
invitation in the third time

474
01:00:53,960 --> 01:00:57,959
...you will see a different side of me.

475
01:00:58,480 --> 01:01:03,999
I don't wait for invitation from
somewhere I already own, Sultan Yakup.

476
01:01:06,040 --> 01:01:08,519
Now tell me.

477
01:01:08,840 --> 01:01:12,159
What is your answer to my offer?

478
01:01:12,360 --> 01:01:15,599
Will you bring the princess to me...

479
01:01:16,040 --> 01:01:19,559
...and stay away from my wrath?

480
01:01:19,720 --> 01:01:23,679
Or choose to vanish with Osman...

481
01:01:23,760 --> 01:01:28,239
..in the frontiers?

482
01:01:30,200 --> 01:01:35,999
Equating me with Osman
would do no good for you, Amir.

483
01:01:41,120 --> 01:01:47,719
I'm the sultan of this land. I
never make a move with a threat.

484
01:01:49,520 --> 01:01:54,519
Sultan Yakup, don't you see?

485
01:01:54,760 --> 01:02:00,279
Osman is gathering all the
Turkish beys around himself.

486
01:02:00,600 --> 01:02:04,399
And you are staying alone.

487
01:02:07,480 --> 01:02:12,039
Sultans are always alone, Amir.

488
01:02:12,240 --> 01:02:15,039
This is not something new.

489
01:02:17,920 --> 01:02:21,679
However, they are alone
when they are standing straight.

490
01:02:21,760 --> 01:02:25,519
They have a lot of people with
them when they are on the ground.

491
01:02:25,560 --> 01:02:28,159
After Osman's acts..

492
01:02:28,240 --> 01:02:34,239
..your people will leave you too, Sultan Yakup.

493
01:02:35,200 --> 01:02:38,479
Do you know what will happen..

494
01:02:38,600 --> 01:02:42,359
..after I marry with the princess?

495
01:02:42,520 --> 01:02:48,119
Ilkhanate's power will grow.

496
01:02:49,880 --> 01:02:53,719
Why should I get in between you and Osman..

497
01:02:53,880 --> 01:02:58,039
..just because Ilkhanate will gain power?

498
01:02:58,120 --> 01:03:01,679
Because if you bring me the princess..

499
01:03:01,800 --> 01:03:04,999
..you will be allies with Ilkhanids.

500
01:03:05,120 --> 01:03:09,439
My power will be your power.

501
01:03:10,320 --> 01:03:13,439
If you say no,

502
01:03:13,480 --> 01:03:16,799
my spies in your lands await news from me.

503
01:03:17,520 --> 01:03:20,239
To be a friend to a friend..

504
01:03:20,560 --> 01:03:23,759
..and a foe to a foe.

505
01:03:24,440 --> 01:03:27,719
Then, send the word, Emir.

506
01:03:28,400 --> 01:03:32,519
Since you came to our door with good intentions..

507
01:03:33,080 --> 01:03:35,919
..I will not refuse.

508
01:03:37,000 --> 01:03:41,159
I will bring the princess to you.

509
01:03:42,920 --> 01:03:47,239
You are on the right path, Yakup.

510
01:03:48,360 --> 01:03:54,119
May your Sultanate live long.
You are on the right path.

511
01:03:56,160 --> 01:03:59,559
You are on the right path.

512
01:04:13,040 --> 01:04:14,879
Did anyone follow you?

513
01:04:15,080 --> 01:04:19,119
I don't think so. I was
cautious my bey, however..

514
01:04:22,360 --> 01:04:25,919
Shall we increase the alps, my shahzade?

515
01:04:26,560 --> 01:04:31,919
No. If we increase the
alps, we will draw suspicion.

516
01:04:33,080 --> 01:04:36,319
Increasing the scouts on
the roads would be enough.

517
01:04:40,280 --> 01:04:44,919
We will reach our destination.

518
01:04:46,800 --> 01:04:50,879
If we can have this princess,
we can make both mongols..

519
01:04:51,040 --> 01:04:54,079
..and Byzantine do as we say.

520
01:04:55,280 --> 01:04:58,199
If Allah permits, my brother.

521
01:04:58,600 --> 01:05:03,319
If Allah permits. However, princess might not be here.

522
01:05:04,920 --> 01:05:07,399
Princess is here.

523
01:05:07,520 --> 01:05:12,799
If not, then Alaeddin wouldn't be
here. Cerkutay wouldn't have come here.

524
01:05:15,840 --> 01:05:19,959
Bayindir Bey, I will leave now.
The princess is in your hands.

525
01:05:20,040 --> 01:05:24,799
-Be cautious.
-As you command, my shahzade.

526
01:05:26,880 --> 01:05:29,679
You told me you brought everything, Bayindir Bey.

527
01:05:29,800 --> 01:05:32,919
Princess is here.

528
01:05:37,360 --> 01:05:39,239
One of my chests is missing.

529
01:05:39,320 --> 01:05:43,719
There must be a confusion.
I will have it checked at once.

530
01:05:47,480 --> 01:05:49,999
You?

531
01:05:50,120 --> 01:05:54,399
Are you leaving, Shahzade Alaeddin?

532
01:05:55,400 --> 01:05:58,959
Bayindir Bey will accompany you.

533
01:05:59,640 --> 01:06:02,759
Will you come back?

534
01:06:02,840 --> 01:06:05,719
I will, as soon as possible.

535
01:06:09,000 --> 01:06:12,919
The weather is bad do not get cold.

536
01:06:25,440 --> 01:06:28,479
Come on alps!

537
01:06:30,880 --> 01:06:33,959
My mother is wrong, Gonca.

538
01:06:34,360 --> 01:06:37,839
This Alaeddin does not love you.

539
01:06:38,120 --> 01:06:41,799
They are looking for either a Lord's daughter..

540
01:06:41,920 --> 01:06:45,999
..or a princess as brides.

541
01:06:47,200 --> 01:06:51,839
You are right.

542
01:06:54,000 --> 01:06:57,079
However, this is not the issue.

543
01:06:58,120 --> 01:07:02,199
Tell me when will you catch this princess.

544
01:07:03,360 --> 01:07:06,799
We are few, my Gonca.

545
01:07:06,880 --> 01:07:10,319
They have everywhere guarded.

546
01:07:24,480 --> 01:07:28,199
If we ambush them now, we will lose.

547
01:07:28,640 --> 01:07:34,959
Then, we must inform our
father and come back with alps.

548
01:07:35,440 --> 01:07:38,199
However, we also need to watch them.

549
01:07:40,080 --> 01:07:44,159
It is not certain what they will do.

550
01:07:45,880 --> 01:07:50,039
-My brother, should I stay here?
-No.

551
01:07:53,840 --> 01:07:59,599
We know their location.
Leaving two alps will suffice.

552
01:08:00,480 --> 01:08:05,319
We will go together. Come on.

553
01:08:18,399 --> 01:08:24,198
Oh praise be! It does not surprise me.

554
01:08:27,479 --> 01:08:31,999
-Are you alright?
-Thank Allah, my bey.

555
01:08:36,680 --> 01:08:39,318
Father.

556
01:08:42,720 --> 01:08:45,479
My Osman Bey.

557
01:08:47,200 --> 01:08:51,158
-My son.

558
01:08:53,920 --> 01:08:56,759
This is not the time.

559
01:08:58,560 --> 01:09:01,879
We will talk later.

560
01:09:17,200 --> 01:09:20,198
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

561
01:09:20,240 --> 01:09:23,759
You are saying you accepted Gorklu Khan's offer.

562
01:09:23,960 --> 01:09:28,679
However, can we trust him, Yakup Bey?

563
01:09:30,600 --> 01:09:32,999
Never.

564
01:09:34,640 --> 01:09:39,999
However, being allies with us now..

565
01:09:40,160 --> 01:09:42,599
..benefits him.

566
01:09:42,920 --> 01:09:46,118
He knows we will find the
princess before anyone else.

567
01:09:46,200 --> 01:09:51,158
What about us? How will it benefits us..

568
01:09:51,240 --> 01:09:53,999
..after Gorklu Khan marries the princess?

569
01:09:56,200 --> 01:10:00,599
We will be allies with Ilkhanids and Byzantine..

570
01:10:00,760 --> 01:10:04,479
..for a while.

571
01:10:05,920 --> 01:10:09,119
I will have Osman live..

572
01:10:09,200 --> 01:10:12,239
..in misery like he never had before.

573
01:10:13,280 --> 01:10:18,879
The beys that stood behind him
will come to my side one by one.

574
01:10:19,240 --> 01:10:24,279
No one will dare to challenge me again.

575
01:10:24,440 --> 01:10:30,919
What about Holofira? Will we not
have them answer for our bride?

576
01:10:31,760 --> 01:10:35,999
Of course we will.

577
01:10:36,360 --> 01:10:42,199
However, let us first wait for
Gonca and Mehmed to come back.

578
01:10:42,840 --> 01:10:46,479
-Are we allowed, my father? -Come in.

579
01:10:54,000 --> 01:10:57,079
Tell me, what is the situation?

580
01:10:57,240 --> 01:11:00,479
-Did you find the princess?
-We did, father.

581
01:11:00,600 --> 01:11:05,759
I memorized their place. I
left two alps there just in case.

582
01:11:07,520 --> 01:11:11,559
Good, you thought good.

583
01:11:13,440 --> 01:11:15,519
-Kanyumaz.
-My Sultan.

584
01:11:15,640 --> 01:11:20,039
Send word to Gorklu Khan. We found the princess.

585
01:11:20,600 --> 01:11:23,959
She will be in our hands
tomorrow at the very least.

586
01:11:24,040 --> 01:11:27,199
As you command, my Sultan.

587
01:11:28,760 --> 01:11:32,159
Mehmed, Gonca.

588
01:11:33,280 --> 01:11:38,519
You take the alps and go
where princess is being held.

589
01:11:38,840 --> 01:11:43,279
Bring the princess here as soon as possible.

590
01:11:43,880 --> 01:11:48,519
We will ruin Osman's trickery.

591
01:11:48,640 --> 01:11:52,039
As you command, my father.

592
01:11:52,760 --> 01:11:55,559
However, if you see fit..

593
01:11:56,080 --> 01:11:59,239
..let my sister stay here.

594
01:12:00,080 --> 01:12:03,799
I do not run away from my duty, brother.

595
01:12:06,120 --> 01:12:10,559
I know, my sister. You fight
better than the mightiest soldier.

596
01:12:11,120 --> 01:12:16,879
However, you should be tired.
There are many alps, we can handle it.

597
01:12:23,160 --> 01:12:27,319
What is it Mehmed? Did something happen?

598
01:12:28,640 --> 01:12:31,879
No, mother. It is nothing.

599
01:12:36,080 --> 01:12:39,959
Let me tell you what it is.

600
01:12:41,520 --> 01:12:46,399
He does not want to take me with him
because Alaeddin Bey is with the princess.

601
01:12:52,440 --> 01:12:58,599
If you insist on coming, I will
start to think it is because of him.

602
01:13:02,360 --> 01:13:05,879
However my father sees fit.

603
01:13:09,640 --> 01:13:13,279
Mehmed will go with his alps.

604
01:13:14,200 --> 01:13:17,559
And you will stay here.

605
01:13:18,120 --> 01:13:23,799
And we will do an important
visit with your mother.

606
01:13:29,520 --> 01:13:33,719
Osman thinks he formed a beylic.

607
01:13:34,000 --> 01:13:38,359
Now he declares himself as "The Ottoman".

608
01:13:39,000 --> 01:13:44,439
Today is the day to show him that he is nothing.

609
01:13:49,080 --> 01:13:52,719
Mehmed, go and take that princess.

610
01:13:53,040 --> 01:13:58,759
As you command, my father. I will have
that princess even if it costs my life.

611
01:14:10,080 --> 01:14:14,639
-Am I allowed, my Sultan?
-Come in.

612
01:14:17,520 --> 01:14:22,599
My Sultan. Orhan and
Holofira arrived at Yenisehir.

613
01:14:27,280 --> 01:14:30,639
I know what to do with them.

614
01:14:32,520 --> 01:14:37,719
Hatun, get ready. We will leave soon.

615
01:14:49,720 --> 01:14:53,599
Allah's mercy shall be upon you.

616
01:14:54,000 --> 01:14:56,759
Allah's mercy shall be upon you.

617
01:15:07,160 --> 01:15:10,319
My Allah..

618
01:15:10,480 --> 01:15:14,919
My Allah, my Allah, my Allah...

619
01:15:15,200 --> 01:15:18,439
I am at Your door, my Allah.

620
01:15:18,520 --> 01:15:23,799
May You show mercy to this poor subject of Yours.

621
01:15:24,080 --> 01:15:27,199
I am walking on this way to
make the dream of the state...

622
01:15:27,960 --> 01:15:31,999
..I had come true, my Allah.

623
01:15:32,240 --> 01:15:36,919
As I walk, I encounter many obstacles...

624
01:15:37,040 --> 01:15:41,799
...many oppressors, and many enemies.

625
01:15:42,120 --> 01:15:47,079
To defeat them, I trust...

626
01:15:47,200 --> 01:15:51,719
...and take refuge in You
alone, my Allah. My Allah...

627
01:15:52,920 --> 01:15:59,399
May You give me power
and strength to defeat my...

628
01:15:59,680 --> 01:16:04,039
...secret enemies and other
enemies that I know, my Allah.

629
01:16:05,200 --> 01:16:07,839
My Allah...

630
01:16:13,440 --> 01:16:16,999
You are the One Who makes enemies friends...

631
01:16:17,080 --> 01:16:21,799
...and friends enemies, my Allah.

632
01:16:22,480 --> 01:16:27,399
May You give unity and order to
my people and my family, my Allah...

633
01:16:27,600 --> 01:16:31,359
I know...
I know that...

634
01:16:31,480 --> 01:16:35,359
Those who have big dreams...

635
01:16:36,240 --> 01:16:39,239
...encounter big and difficult tests.

636
01:16:41,040 --> 01:16:44,119
My Allah..

637
01:16:44,440 --> 01:16:48,999
Do not turn my dreams into a burden,
make them turn into my companion...

638
01:16:49,160 --> 01:16:53,079
Turn them into a companion, my Allah...

639
01:16:53,440 --> 01:16:56,319
May You grant me with...

640
01:16:56,480 --> 01:17:01,599
...the honesty I need to be on the straight path.

641
01:17:04,520 --> 01:17:09,719
Accept our prayers, my Allah. Aameen.

642
01:17:29,480 --> 01:17:33,039
I will turn this palace into my
barn after everything is over.

643
01:17:33,120 --> 01:17:37,999
Keep your intentions and anger
hidden, my friend. We are at their table.

644
01:17:39,280 --> 01:17:44,719
Lord! Let us hear what you are saying.

645
01:17:44,800 --> 01:17:48,599
You'll learn when the time comes.

646
01:17:49,280 --> 01:17:53,959
Attention! Osman Bey!

647
01:17:54,920 --> 01:18:00,359
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

648
01:18:09,360 --> 01:18:14,719
Welcome... Welcome. Welcome.

649
01:18:15,040 --> 01:18:18,159
You may sit.

650
01:18:38,200 --> 01:18:44,239
If you keep sharpening your
swords against each other...

651
01:18:44,400 --> 01:18:49,319
...then... It will be inevitable
for us to get killed...

652
01:18:49,400 --> 01:18:53,559
...by Mongols.

653
01:18:57,960 --> 01:19:01,719
Tell me. Have you investigated this matter?

654
01:19:01,960 --> 01:19:08,039
My contact in Constantinople confirms
the information you provided, Osman Bey.

655
01:19:08,160 --> 01:19:14,279
So... What we know is true.

656
01:19:16,280 --> 01:19:20,559
I can't understand how the
Emperor did this, Osman Bey.

657
01:19:20,960 --> 01:19:26,879
In these lands, agreements are written in blood.

658
01:19:27,480 --> 01:19:31,759
The Emperor wants to
protect himself and his power..

659
01:19:32,240 --> 01:19:35,639
...with you.

660
01:19:35,720 --> 01:19:40,199
Thus, he is sacrificing you.

661
01:19:43,600 --> 01:19:46,999
Mongols...

662
01:19:47,360 --> 01:19:50,439
..will crush us.

663
01:19:50,920 --> 01:19:55,999
And as a reward, they will take your heads...

664
01:19:56,160 --> 01:19:59,399
...and your lands. You should know that.

665
01:19:59,600 --> 01:20:02,225
But as long as you keep
the Princess in your hands

666
01:20:02,237 --> 01:20:04,719
the agreement will not
be finalized, Osman Bey.

667
01:20:04,800 --> 01:20:09,279
Great Roman Lords owe their lives to a Turk, huh?

668
01:20:09,320 --> 01:20:12,679
Do you think we cannot defeat Mongols?

669
01:20:12,760 --> 01:20:16,079
They can never go beyond our walls!

670
01:20:19,880 --> 01:20:22,999
Lord Leon..

671
01:20:25,640 --> 01:20:32,199
Mongols must never hear your fearless words.

672
01:20:34,120 --> 01:20:36,879
While you rust in your palace...

673
01:20:36,880 --> 01:20:40,639
...they live in the steppes and moorland.

674
01:20:42,640 --> 01:20:48,559
And you are also saying that
they cannot climb over your walls.

675
01:20:49,600 --> 01:20:52,719
Then tell me.

676
01:20:53,080 --> 01:20:58,039
Semerkand, Konya and Baghdad...

677
01:20:58,480 --> 01:21:03,399
Didn't those places have walls? Tell me.

678
01:21:07,120 --> 01:21:11,279
Apparently, you..

679
01:21:12,000 --> 01:21:16,519
...don't even know...

680
01:21:16,600 --> 01:21:21,199
...who you are fighting against.

681
01:21:25,680 --> 01:21:30,439
Everyone is responsible of their people.

682
01:21:30,520 --> 01:21:35,719
But... The situation is obvious.
We don't have much time.

683
01:21:37,160 --> 01:21:41,279
And those Mongols will not show mercy to anyone.

684
01:21:41,400 --> 01:21:46,759
They will crush them. Therefore...

685
01:21:47,680 --> 01:21:52,559
...when we still have time, I am telling you...

686
01:21:56,400 --> 01:22:00,439
Bow down before me.

687
01:22:02,640 --> 01:22:05,479
If you accept...

688
01:22:05,480 --> 01:22:09,199
...I will consider your people as my own people.

689
01:22:09,320 --> 01:22:12,839
I will protect them.

690
01:22:15,160 --> 01:22:20,439
Don't forget... From now on....

691
01:22:21,000 --> 01:22:25,959
..there is a state here.

692
01:22:34,360 --> 01:22:37,719
And your future...

693
01:22:37,840 --> 01:22:40,719
...is under our sanjak.

694
01:22:40,800 --> 01:22:46,399
If I was not mad at the Emperor,
I would never accept that.

695
01:22:47,240 --> 01:22:50,079
I am with you, Osman Bey.

696
01:22:50,760 --> 01:22:55,199
-We are with you, Osman Bey.
-Thank you, thank you.

697
01:23:02,080 --> 01:23:06,359
We are with you Osman Bey!

698
01:23:13,000 --> 01:23:19,399
Oh praise be!... Thank you.
Thank you...

699
01:23:21,600 --> 01:23:26,239
If Allah permits we will unite under one sanjak.

700
01:23:26,520 --> 01:23:31,199
And... we will stay there forever.

701
01:23:37,960 --> 01:23:40,799
-Boran!
-My Bey.

702
01:23:41,040 --> 01:23:45,439
Come on. Play your qopuz.
-Yes my Bey.

703
01:23:46,000 --> 01:23:49,199
Can I come in, my Osman Bey?

704
01:23:52,720 --> 01:23:56,479
Come in, Baysungur.

705
01:23:57,960 --> 01:24:01,279
My Bey. Your guests...

706
01:24:01,840 --> 01:24:05,079
Aunt..

707
01:24:07,920 --> 01:24:11,399
Osman Bey! I am Olivia.

708
01:24:11,720 --> 01:24:14,559
I am Holofira's aunt.

709
01:24:18,280 --> 01:24:22,399
And you will give my niece back to me now.

710
01:24:23,120 --> 01:24:27,679
Or else, I will destroy this city.
-Stop there, Hatun!

711
01:24:28,400 --> 01:24:31,959
Are you threatening us in the palace
you entered without permission?

712
01:24:32,040 --> 01:24:35,359
How are you going to do
the thing you just said, huh?

713
01:24:42,680 --> 01:24:45,519
With me.

714
01:24:47,840 --> 01:24:51,159
She will destroy it with me.

715
01:24:57,960 --> 01:25:02,719
Do you have any other questions?

716
01:25:03,280 --> 01:25:07,839
We thought someone was missing...

717
01:25:08,000 --> 01:25:11,079
And now he is here.

718
01:25:13,000 --> 01:25:17,119
Welcome, Yakup Bey.

719
01:25:32,000 --> 01:25:36,559
Alaeddin... Alaeddin!

720
01:25:43,960 --> 01:25:49,639
-When did they notice you?
-Once you left, my Shahzade.

721
01:25:55,400 --> 01:25:58,639
They noticed from the very beginning.

722
01:25:58,840 --> 01:26:01,959
I will kill that Cerkutay!

723
01:26:03,280 --> 01:26:14,319
I will kill that Cerkutay!

724
01:26:17,760 --> 01:26:19,719
Gokmen! -My Shahzade...

725
01:26:19,880 --> 01:26:23,039
Send Alps everywhere! We will find them!

726
01:26:23,240 --> 01:26:24,679
Yes my Shahzade.

727
01:26:24,760 --> 01:26:27,679
We will find that Princess
no matter what happens.

728
01:26:27,880 --> 01:26:31,319
No matter what!

729
01:26:38,280 --> 01:26:43,799
The trace we left will keep
Mehmet far away from us.

730
01:26:43,880 --> 01:26:46,799
He cannot find any traces to come here.

731
01:26:46,880 --> 01:26:49,479
But they will not give up.

732
01:26:49,560 --> 01:26:52,559
If not today, tomorrow.

733
01:26:53,800 --> 01:26:56,639
How long can we hide the Princess?

734
01:26:57,640 --> 01:27:01,279
Forever, if necessary, brother.

735
01:27:05,160 --> 01:27:09,159
This Princses is the soft spot
of Byzantines and Mongols,

736
01:27:09,520 --> 01:27:13,759
the two biggest power.

737
01:27:16,240 --> 01:27:21,359
May Allah forbid, if this
marriage is going to happen

738
01:27:21,480 --> 01:27:26,359
we will be ruined. But as
long as we keep the Princess

739
01:27:26,720 --> 01:27:31,799
both Osman Bey and his Beylik will get stronger.

740
01:27:32,400 --> 01:27:34,879
Come on.

741
01:27:39,040 --> 01:27:42,719
You kidnapped my future
daughter-in-law, on top of that

742
01:27:42,960 --> 01:27:45,759
you lost her to
Mongols as hostage

743
01:27:45,760 --> 01:27:49,119
and as if it's not enough, do
you keep her as a hostage now?

744
01:27:49,200 --> 01:27:52,319
Calm down, Yakup Bey.

745
01:27:53,320 --> 01:27:56,799
Who are we keeping as hostage in our palace?

746
01:27:58,560 --> 01:28:02,959
If something had happened
to Holofira after all this

747
01:28:03,160 --> 01:28:06,199
you'd pay for it heavily.

748
01:28:11,000 --> 01:28:15,079
Don't worry, as long as I am with her

749
01:28:15,240 --> 01:28:18,239
no one can hurt Holofira.

750
01:28:18,320 --> 01:28:22,239
Is there any greater harm to her than you, Orhan?

751
01:28:24,120 --> 01:28:28,119
Hatun, pick your words carefully.

752
01:28:28,200 --> 01:28:31,319
We do not hurt anyone.

753
01:28:31,440 --> 01:28:34,319
If you do not test our patience, of course.

754
01:28:34,400 --> 01:28:38,519
Aunt, please.

755
01:28:44,520 --> 01:28:46,719
Come on, daughter. Let's go.

756
01:28:47,240 --> 01:28:51,399
Yakup Bey.

757
01:29:02,320 --> 01:29:06,119
Who are you taking from our palace?

758
01:29:06,520 --> 01:29:09,919
Do you want me to cut your head, Osman Bey?

759
01:29:12,240 --> 01:29:15,279
Just try it.

760
01:29:15,800 --> 01:29:18,399
Osman!

761
01:29:41,800 --> 01:29:46,959
Holofira will leave if she wants to leave.

762
01:29:47,880 --> 01:29:52,319
But it is up to her.

763
01:30:15,920 --> 01:30:19,439
I will not stay here any longer.

764
01:30:24,960 --> 01:30:29,159
But I will not come with you as well, Yakup Bey.

765
01:30:33,560 --> 01:30:37,159
I'll go back with my aunt.

766
01:31:13,880 --> 01:31:18,879
Now are you having Lords
at your table, Osman Bey?

767
01:31:21,920 --> 01:31:26,279
Your treason has been exposed.

768
01:31:28,160 --> 01:31:33,399
I'm not on the same path as you.

769
01:31:36,120 --> 01:31:40,799
On one side, there is a man who does everything

770
01:31:41,160 --> 01:31:44,599
and does every move.

771
01:31:44,760 --> 01:31:50,279
But on the other side, there's
a man who only threatens

772
01:31:50,560 --> 01:31:55,519
and blocks every move.

773
01:31:59,280 --> 01:32:03,079
The history will write the truth for sure.

774
01:32:04,280 --> 01:32:09,039
Too pity.

775
01:32:10,160 --> 01:32:15,399
History will only write about
your treason, Osman Bey.

776
01:32:18,760 --> 01:32:22,359
My path is clear.

777
01:32:22,560 --> 01:32:25,519
My cause is clear.

778
01:32:27,880 --> 01:32:32,479
Keep that in your mind, on this path

779
01:32:32,640 --> 01:32:36,239
I will show no mercy to anyone I come across

780
01:32:36,640 --> 01:32:40,159
I'll crush him down.

781
01:32:47,240 --> 01:32:50,279
You're right.

782
01:32:50,720 --> 01:32:54,079
We're not on the same path.

783
01:32:54,640 --> 01:32:58,159
Come on, have a safe journey.

784
01:32:59,920 --> 01:33:03,159
Come on.

785
01:33:35,560 --> 01:33:39,079
You have called me, Hadhrat Emir.

786
01:33:43,160 --> 01:33:47,119
Your nokers

787
01:33:47,200 --> 01:33:49,839
lost Orhan.

788
01:33:50,000 --> 01:33:54,919
You came empty-handed. Now tell me.

789
01:33:55,000 --> 01:33:59,079
Why wouldn't I burn you all in fire

790
01:33:59,280 --> 01:34:03,119
Karacelasun?

791
01:34:03,440 --> 01:34:07,799
What are you going to give me except for defeat?

792
01:34:10,280 --> 01:34:15,759
Osman is taking beys' support.

793
01:34:15,840 --> 01:34:19,559
-He's getting stronger.
-Is that all?

794
01:34:20,640 --> 01:34:23,079
He will make his move with the Lords.

795
01:34:23,280 --> 01:34:27,879
Osman intents to make Byzantines attack us.

796
01:34:33,480 --> 01:34:36,879
Are you afraid?

797
01:34:37,320 --> 01:34:40,999
Are you afraid that you will end up

798
01:34:41,240 --> 01:34:44,439
like your brother?

799
01:34:45,480 --> 01:34:50,719
Weren't you here for vengeance, Karacelasun?

800
01:34:51,840 --> 01:34:54,679
Are you going to cry like a woman?

801
01:34:54,800 --> 01:34:58,639
I've never felt fear in my heart.

802
01:34:59,040 --> 01:35:02,599
I have enough power to

803
01:35:02,840 --> 01:35:05,719
destroy Osman, those behind him

804
01:35:05,800 --> 01:35:10,439
and anyone who come towards us!

805
01:35:10,960 --> 01:35:14,439
Hadhrat Emir. We have news from Yakup Bey.

806
01:35:14,520 --> 01:35:18,879
They found the Princess. They
will capture her in the morning.

807
01:35:19,320 --> 01:35:24,199
Yakup. Sultan Yakup.

808
01:35:26,520 --> 01:35:29,719
He does everything to remain Sultan.

809
01:35:29,800 --> 01:35:35,359
Very well. Yakup will bring me the Princess.

810
01:35:35,520 --> 01:35:39,239
When will my army in Konya arrive?

811
01:35:39,320 --> 01:35:40,079
Tong Chu.

812
01:35:40,160 --> 01:35:44,839
-They will be here by the morning, Hadhrat Emir.
-Very well.

813
01:35:48,000 --> 01:35:52,559
When my army arrives, they
will leave for their first duty.

814
01:35:52,640 --> 01:35:56,399
Since Osman is playing tricks against us

815
01:35:56,560 --> 01:36:01,879
I'll bring Osman to hell.

816
01:36:02,240 --> 01:36:06,959
And you will capture the
beyliks that are loyal to Osman.

817
01:36:07,160 --> 01:36:10,839
You will burn their tribes and destroy them.

818
01:36:11,120 --> 01:36:14,159
It is your last chance

819
01:36:14,240 --> 01:36:17,239
Not a single one of them
will be able to help Osman,

820
01:36:17,320 --> 01:36:20,399
they will be in need of help, Hadhrat Emir.

821
01:36:20,640 --> 01:36:25,759
By sunrise you will have surrounded the beyliks.

822
01:36:25,920 --> 01:36:29,639
Karacelasun, gather your nokers.

823
01:36:29,880 --> 01:36:33,599
I'll do as you
order, Hadhrat Emir.

824
01:36:40,640 --> 01:36:42,959
-Boran.
-My Bey.

825
01:36:43,520 --> 01:36:47,399
-Come on now, open the map.
-Yes, my Bey.

826
01:36:56,560 --> 01:36:59,959
Praise be.

827
01:37:07,720 --> 01:37:11,519
In the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate.

828
01:37:12,440 --> 01:37:17,319
Here, the borders of our Beylik

829
01:37:17,720 --> 01:37:22,799
starts here, goes forward

830
01:37:22,880 --> 01:37:26,999
and goes all the way to the here.

831
01:37:28,800 --> 01:37:33,599
Paths and routes here...

832
01:37:36,840 --> 01:37:39,919
...are under our control.

833
01:37:42,160 --> 01:37:46,439
No one without paying taxes

834
01:37:46,720 --> 01:37:51,319
and without permissions will be able to enter.

835
01:37:52,280 --> 01:37:54,599
Everyone, my Bey?

836
01:37:55,560 --> 01:37:58,879
Everyone who is not

837
01:38:00,840 --> 01:38:03,959
under our command.

838
01:38:04,280 --> 01:38:08,559
Candar, Karesi

839
01:38:09,080 --> 01:38:12,519
and Germiyan.

840
01:38:12,680 --> 01:38:17,199
-It doesn't matter.
-Yes, my Bey.

841
01:38:17,400 --> 01:38:21,599
From now on, we will collect
taxes from the Lords as well.

842
01:38:21,800 --> 01:38:26,039
So there will be a lot of
transfers in and out of the treasury.

843
01:38:27,200 --> 01:38:32,319
As the chief treasurer,

844
01:38:33,920 --> 01:38:36,159
Bayindir Bey will deal with the treasury.

845
01:38:36,560 --> 01:38:40,399
Inform him.
Yes, my Bey.

846
01:38:40,880 --> 01:38:44,399
Also, write this down.

847
01:38:44,560 --> 01:38:47,719
Yes, my Bey.

848
01:38:49,680 --> 01:38:56,119
Malhun Hatun, now, Lords agreed
to take the goods to Yenisehir.

849
01:38:56,480 --> 01:39:03,279
Some will even bring the
goods from Constantinople.

850
01:39:04,040 --> 01:39:08,159
So the Yenisehir marketplace...

851
01:39:08,280 --> 01:39:11,639
-...is under your responsibility.
-Yes, my Bey.

852
01:39:13,840 --> 01:39:17,039
We are fighting a total war.

853
01:39:17,520 --> 01:39:21,519
When alps go to the battle, the lands and tribes

854
01:39:21,600 --> 01:39:23,679
will be defenseless

855
01:39:24,000 --> 01:39:27,479
So, that is why

856
01:39:27,560 --> 01:39:31,919
the protection of the Lords
is also our responsibility.

857
01:39:33,080 --> 01:39:35,679
So we cannot let that happen.

858
01:39:38,040 --> 01:39:40,439
Bala Hatun.

859
01:39:40,720 --> 01:39:45,559
You will turn Sogut into
the headquarter of Sisters.

860
01:39:46,160 --> 01:39:50,799
They will have absolute resistance
against any kind of cruelty.

861
01:39:50,880 --> 01:39:54,439
-As you order, my Bey.
-Thank you.

862
01:39:57,040 --> 01:40:04,359
We need to send a judge and a
teacher to each tribe in no time.

863
01:40:04,520 --> 01:40:08,519
-Write this down too.
-As you order, my Bey.

864
01:40:10,960 --> 01:40:14,959
What about the borders, my
Bey? Won't we expand them?

865
01:40:15,520 --> 01:40:20,719
Well, son... This is one of the laws of a beylic.

866
01:40:22,880 --> 01:40:27,879
The one that doesn't expand has to become arrow.

867
01:40:30,760 --> 01:40:38,879
Now... Our destination will be Kite.

868
01:40:39,800 --> 01:40:44,279
Then I will provide alps and
food from Kestel to Kite, my Bey.

869
01:40:51,480 --> 01:40:54,519
You won't, Orhan.

870
01:40:57,680 --> 01:41:00,119
Kestel..

871
01:41:02,760 --> 01:41:06,239
...isn't your property anymore.

872
01:41:14,800 --> 01:41:19,559
Karacahisar isn't your property either.

873
01:41:27,920 --> 01:41:31,119
You need to deserve them first.

874
01:41:34,960 --> 01:41:41,119
Your latest mistakes caused too many troubles.

875
01:41:48,440 --> 01:41:51,519
As Osman Bey orders.

876
01:42:05,760 --> 01:42:12,879
The council is over! Bala Hatun
Malhun Hatun. You two stay.

877
01:42:17,000 --> 01:42:20,119
You may leave.

878
01:42:40,920 --> 01:42:45,679
Today, we will avenge...

879
01:42:45,880 --> 01:42:50,399
...all the Mongolians who died in the frontiers!

880
01:42:56,040 --> 01:43:01,159
You, the savages of Amir Coban!

881
01:43:04,680 --> 01:43:07,839
My loyal nokers!

882
01:43:07,880 --> 01:43:13,839
We will make the blood of Turks flow in rivers!

883
01:43:24,560 --> 01:43:30,359
I will take Osman's heart out.

884
01:43:32,520 --> 01:43:37,999
Here we go! We're holding hell in our hands!

885
01:43:38,200 --> 01:43:42,719
Get ready to burn everywhere!

886
01:44:01,720 --> 01:44:05,039
Attention! Osman Bey!

887
01:44:11,160 --> 01:44:13,999
My Bey, all the alps are
ready to go on a campaign.

888
01:44:14,040 --> 01:44:17,119
Okay, okay.

889
01:44:17,360 --> 01:44:23,519
My alps! My brave warriors!
My solid-hearted lions!

890
01:44:25,000 --> 01:44:30,639
Our becoming a state in the frontiers
has driven the enemy completely mad!

891
01:44:31,240 --> 01:44:38,199
Jackals disguised as sheep
have already showed their teeth!

892
01:44:40,040 --> 01:44:44,719
The Lord of Kite is only one of them.

893
01:44:45,720 --> 01:44:52,919
After we defeat him, Bursa and
Iznik will be the next. For this reason,

894
01:44:53,120 --> 01:44:56,439
...we will crush the Lord of Kite!

895
01:44:58,760 --> 01:45:03,359
We’ll overcome the obstacles one
by one and maintain order in the world.

896
01:45:03,520 --> 01:45:08,519
Alps! We perform campaigns!

897
01:45:08,920 --> 01:45:11,839
Allah provides victory!

898
01:45:12,000 --> 01:45:16,399
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest, Allah is the greatest!

899
01:45:27,880 --> 01:45:31,279
May your campaign be blessed, my Bey.

900
01:45:33,360 --> 01:45:37,559
May your fight be holy, my
Bey. Come back with good news.

901
01:45:37,880 --> 01:45:42,399
Thank you. Thank you. I trust you for Yenisehir.

902
01:45:45,760 --> 01:45:50,159
Father, let me go with you.

903
01:45:50,400 --> 01:45:53,439
I've been training for long.

904
01:45:56,200 --> 01:45:59,559
My dear daughter. I'm going on a campaign now.

905
01:45:59,640 --> 01:46:03,319
But when I'm back, we will train together.

906
01:46:03,440 --> 01:46:06,439
I will make my decision according to that.

907
01:46:07,400 --> 01:46:10,519
Alaaddin.
-My Bey.

908
01:46:10,880 --> 01:46:14,719
Yakup Bey won't stop chasing the princess.

909
01:46:15,040 --> 01:46:18,399
-Keep your eye on him.
-As my Bey orders.

910
01:46:18,400 --> 01:46:21,799
I won't let them find the princess
at the cost of my life, father.

911
01:46:21,800 --> 01:46:24,519
Thank you, thank you.

912
01:46:26,280 --> 01:46:28,919
-Orhan.
-My Bey.

913
01:46:28,920 --> 01:46:34,199
Well... If the enemy hear
that we're out of Yenisehir

914
01:46:34,320 --> 01:46:37,479
...they may attack here.

915
01:46:37,680 --> 01:46:42,959
Take some alps with you
and wait in a middle spot.

916
01:46:44,280 --> 01:46:48,959
You will strike in case they attempt to attack.

917
01:46:49,040 --> 01:46:52,959
As you order, my Bey. I
will strike like a thunder!

918
01:46:52,960 --> 01:46:56,519
Thank you, thank you.

919
01:46:56,720 --> 01:47:02,559
Come on then. It's time for campaign!

920
01:47:06,120 --> 01:47:10,719
Allah is the greatest! Allah is the greatest!

921
01:47:17,400 --> 01:47:22,079
Aunt, what do you mean I won't go to the
frontier market again? I have an agreement.

922
01:47:22,080 --> 01:47:26,279
It's over. Your agreement is over.

923
01:47:27,520 --> 01:47:31,519
You'll close your shop in the
frontier market. From now on

924
01:47:31,600 --> 01:47:35,719
...you won't go to the frontier
market or Yenisehir again.

925
01:47:35,880 --> 01:47:39,759
-But why?
-Are you even asking, Holofira?

926
01:47:40,080 --> 01:47:43,239
Have you forgotten what you went through?

927
01:47:43,760 --> 01:47:47,759
First Orhan, then Mongolians...

928
01:47:50,360 --> 01:47:53,479
I can't put you in danger anymore.

929
01:47:54,040 --> 01:47:56,159
But it wasn't Orhan's fault.

930
01:47:56,160 --> 01:48:01,119
Don't defend a man who can't
protect you. This is my final words.

931
01:48:02,160 --> 01:48:05,239
You won't get out of the castle anymore.

932
01:48:08,360 --> 01:48:12,959
-My lady, we got a letter for you.
-Get out.

933
01:48:18,480 --> 01:48:22,559
Aunt, for the last time, just let me go...

934
01:48:22,760 --> 01:48:26,559
No. You won't leave the castle.

935
01:48:46,480 --> 01:48:52,079
Orhan. You made me worry, son.

936
01:48:54,720 --> 01:48:57,759
I had no other options, mother.

937
01:48:58,240 --> 01:49:02,959
Mehmed on one side and
Holofira's aunt on the other.

938
01:49:03,520 --> 01:49:07,999
And... And you.

939
01:49:09,640 --> 01:49:15,959
Mother, Holofira needs some time to be a Muslim.

940
01:49:16,080 --> 01:49:19,839
-Before we teach her Islam...
-Teach her then, son.

941
01:49:20,800 --> 01:49:23,399
I have plenty of time.
I can wait.

942
01:49:23,440 --> 01:49:26,199
But don't you blame me for this issue.

943
01:49:26,280 --> 01:49:29,119
You don't accept Holofira, mother.

944
01:49:29,480 --> 01:49:35,439
You leave me no other options.
See? I've lost my mission.

945
01:49:35,880 --> 01:49:39,359
You lost your mission because
of your own mistake, Orhan Bey.

946
01:49:39,600 --> 01:49:42,239
This is what exactly I tried to tell you.

947
01:49:42,280 --> 01:49:48,359
You are a bey. You should think a thousand
times and make one move like a bey.

948
01:49:49,360 --> 01:49:53,679
I'm being late for my duty, mother.
Excuse me.

949
01:49:54,320 --> 01:49:58,199
Holofira s love causes you
to make mistakes, Orhan.

950
01:50:00,160 --> 01:50:03,639
If I have made a mistake,

951
01:50:03,960 --> 01:50:07,799
...I will pay the price, mother.

952
01:50:15,000 --> 01:50:19,279
You are the fire. And Holofira is the wind.

953
01:50:19,760 --> 01:50:23,879
This wind will only make the fire grow bigger.

954
01:50:39,840 --> 01:50:42,839
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

955
01:50:43,400 --> 01:50:48,119
You should find the princess no matter what.

956
01:50:48,240 --> 01:50:51,559
I will bring her back this time, father.

957
01:50:52,440 --> 01:50:58,519
Gonca, this mission is yours.

958
01:51:01,720 --> 01:51:05,199
Don't send Gonca, father.
Alaaddin is holding the princess.

959
01:51:05,320 --> 01:51:08,399
-If you...
-How dare you speak words...

960
01:51:08,440 --> 01:51:11,879
...against mine, Mehmed?

961
01:51:15,240 --> 01:51:19,959
You have another duty.
You will bring intelligence...

962
01:51:20,160 --> 01:51:24,039
..about Osman.

963
01:51:25,040 --> 01:51:30,919
-As you order, father.
-Come on. Everybody get to their duties.

964
01:51:37,920 --> 01:51:41,759
Change your way when
you see impertinent Alaaddin.

965
01:51:42,760 --> 01:51:46,639
You won't speak to him, Gonca. Do you get it?

966
01:51:50,720 --> 01:51:54,839
Why are you giving Gonca such duties, Yakup Bey?

967
01:51:55,560 --> 01:51:59,119
I'm testing my daughter, hatun.

968
01:51:59,680 --> 01:52:04,319
She achieved her first duty.

969
01:52:05,920 --> 01:52:10,079
She took the merchants from Bala Hatun.

970
01:52:10,400 --> 01:52:12,639
If she achieves this too..

971
01:52:13,200 --> 01:52:18,319
If she brings the princess
to me despite Alaaddin...

972
01:52:18,640 --> 01:52:21,639
What will you do then, Yakup Bey?

973
01:52:31,040 --> 01:52:35,519
-Welcome, Bala Hatun.
-Thank you.

974
01:52:36,640 --> 01:52:41,919
-Welcome Bala Hatun.
-May your work be easy.

975
01:52:44,040 --> 01:52:45,719
-Mother.
-Yes?

976
01:52:45,880 --> 01:52:49,879
-Where is brother Alaaddin?
-He’s on duty, dear.

977
01:52:49,880 --> 01:52:54,839
-Dealing with our guest.
-He's gone after Gonca Hatun.

978
01:52:54,920 --> 01:53:00,199
-He must be in the frontier market.
-You shut up.

979
01:53:02,160 --> 01:53:06,039
Bala Hatun. Forgive me, but...

980
01:53:06,080 --> 01:53:08,719
...your son is my rival now.

981
01:53:08,720 --> 01:53:10,879
-Really?
-I'm going!

982
01:53:10,920 --> 01:53:13,719
Where are you going? Where?

983
01:53:14,360 --> 01:53:17,630
Her demon mother doesn't ever
let her marry Shahzade Alaaddin.

984
01:53:17,630 --> 01:53:19,400
You think you can marry her, Ghazi?

985
01:53:19,400 --> 01:53:24,239
Why doesn't she let her marry Shahzade?

986
01:53:25,720 --> 01:53:29,799
A girl's family play hard
to get, Ghazi Alp. We'll see.

987
01:53:30,040 --> 01:53:34,079
-If she doesn't let...
-I will kidnap her! Even before Shahzade!

988
01:53:34,200 --> 01:53:36,999
But I need coins and more training.

989
01:53:37,240 --> 01:53:41,839
-I'm going!
-All you need is coins and training, Ghazi.

990
01:53:42,400 --> 01:53:45,599
I'll take him to the palace. He is misbehaving.

991
01:53:48,200 --> 01:53:54,319
Mother. Will we really snatch
Gonca Hatun if they don't give her up?

992
01:53:54,440 --> 01:53:59,479
We will see. If we will snatch
her or get her father's permission.

993
01:53:59,640 --> 01:54:03,479
Time will tell.

994
01:54:03,800 --> 01:54:07,559
-You will be a mother to her as well, right?
-Should I?

995
01:54:07,640 --> 01:54:12,119
-You should.
-Alright I will a little.

996
01:54:13,840 --> 01:54:17,679
Osman Bey is coming!

997
01:54:27,920 --> 01:54:30,799
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

998
01:54:30,880 --> 01:54:35,759
-What's the situation?
-Alps are repairing battering ram for the door.

999
01:54:35,920 --> 01:54:39,439
The army would be ready
to move until midafternoon.

1000
01:54:39,520 --> 01:54:42,479
Alright, alright, alright.

1001
01:54:43,400 --> 01:54:47,839
My Bey. We just came to an agreement yesterday.

1002
01:54:47,920 --> 01:54:51,319
I know Lord can not be trusted.

1003
01:54:51,480 --> 01:54:54,599
However, wouldn't a move like
this draw us away from other lords?

1004
01:54:54,760 --> 01:54:59,679
The Lord of Kite is not my target
because his tongue is not still.

1005
01:54:59,800 --> 01:55:05,559
-But because of his treachery.
-Do we know something, my bey?

1006
01:55:07,000 --> 01:55:10,799
He told everything to the
Lords of Iznik and Bursa.

1007
01:55:11,000 --> 01:55:15,119
They took orders from them
and came to an agreement with us.

1008
01:55:15,560 --> 01:55:19,479
He will strike us from behind
in the first chance he gets.

1009
01:55:19,840 --> 01:55:23,959
Not only this, he also wants
to cooperate with Yakup Bey.

1010
01:55:26,120 --> 01:55:29,639
I won't even make a guard dog out of those..

1011
01:55:29,720 --> 01:55:32,439
..who become slaves to our enemies.

1012
01:55:33,200 --> 01:55:38,639
Now, we will distribute
the treasure of Kite to lords.

1013
01:55:38,720 --> 01:55:43,399
-And they will keep their mouths shut.
-Okay, my bey.

1014
01:55:44,080 --> 01:55:47,719
Someone's coming!

1015
01:55:54,600 --> 01:55:59,599
-Peace be upon you Osman Bey.
-Peace be upon you Solgur Aga.

1016
01:56:08,240 --> 01:56:10,359
Praise be.

1017
01:56:12,560 --> 01:56:15,999
You are welcomed.

1018
01:56:16,120 --> 01:56:19,879
In this glorious war path..

1019
01:56:20,000 --> 01:56:25,079
..I brought valiant warriors.
All of whom a lion each,

1020
01:56:25,200 --> 01:56:29,679
..trained by Gaziyan. We are ready for war.

1021
01:56:29,760 --> 01:56:35,479
Praise be, praise be!
We will win many conquests..

1022
01:56:35,560 --> 01:56:39,159
..many wars and victories thanks to them.

1023
01:56:39,240 --> 01:56:45,199
“May Gaziyans live long.
“If Allah permits Osman Bey, If Allah permits.

1024
01:56:49,280 --> 01:56:51,239
Konur.

1025
01:56:53,160 --> 01:56:56,319
-Yes, my bey.
-We will be at Kite..

1026
01:56:56,440 --> 01:56:59,439
..before midafternoon.

1027
01:56:59,760 --> 01:57:03,639
-Now, finish your preparations.
-As you command, my bey.

1028
01:57:23,000 --> 01:57:28,879
They must've left a track.
We will look thoroughly sisters.

1029
01:57:29,760 --> 01:57:34,999
We will find that princess.
Come on sisters, look everywhere!

1030
01:57:35,240 --> 01:57:40,879
Guice, send two alps behind Alaeddin
Bey. They shall follow him cautiously.

1031
01:57:40,960 --> 01:57:44,359
-As you command, Gonca Hatun.
-Come on.

1032
01:58:39,520 --> 01:58:42,519
I do not get followed, Trickster Hatun.

1033
01:58:42,600 --> 01:58:46,479
-Alaeddin Bey.
-Welcome, Coy Hatun.

1034
01:58:46,840 --> 01:58:50,879
You just couldn't fall back.
So we really had to be square.

1035
01:58:51,360 --> 01:58:54,582
-Tell me, what are
you doing here?

1036
01:58:54,594 --> 01:58:57,559
Yakup Bey is
after the princess.

1037
01:59:00,680 --> 01:59:04,479
He has skilled scouts. They're all around.

1038
01:59:04,560 --> 01:59:07,159
You are after the princess.

1039
01:59:08,280 --> 01:59:13,679
I saw you yesterday. I knew
you would be back to track us.

1040
01:59:13,760 --> 01:59:19,439
Right, I am after the princess.
And what are you after?

1041
01:59:26,240 --> 01:59:30,719
She must be really worried about you.
Go along then, don't keep her worried!

1042
01:59:31,080 --> 01:59:35,199
What is it? Are you
jealous of me?

1043
01:59:38,200 --> 01:59:41,399
Jealous Hatun.

1044
01:59:48,800 --> 01:59:53,759
What happened? Are you hurt? Sorry.

1045
01:59:53,840 --> 01:59:58,199
It is duty, don't be jealous.

1046
01:59:59,440 --> 02:00:04,959
My eyes are blind to others than you.

1047
02:00:05,160 --> 02:00:09,519
My ears do not hear others but you.

1048
02:00:11,240 --> 02:00:17,279
If you ask about this heart
of mine? It is already tied up.

1049
02:00:22,440 --> 02:00:26,839
You hit hard, Jealous Hatun.

1050
02:00:32,320 --> 02:00:35,919
Our duties put us against each
other time and time again Alaeddin.

1051
02:00:36,360 --> 02:00:39,719
This will always be like
that. You know that right?

1052
02:00:39,800 --> 02:00:43,799
No. It won't be always like this.

1053
02:00:44,000 --> 02:00:49,599
All will be well, after we get married.

1054
02:00:51,640 --> 02:00:56,039
What if they don't? Alaeddin
what if blood gets between us?

1055
02:00:56,120 --> 02:00:59,079
Hold on.

1056
02:00:59,320 --> 02:01:03,959
Don't invite the bad things. We
shall think good so it may be good.

1057
02:01:05,600 --> 02:01:07,799
We will get married.

1058
02:01:07,920 --> 02:01:10,839
-Alaeddin!
-Brother!

1059
02:01:11,000 --> 02:01:13,919
Who will you marry with?

1060
02:01:14,040 --> 02:01:16,919
Brother! Stop, what are you doing?

1061
02:01:17,320 --> 02:01:21,159
Brother!

1062
02:01:31,400 --> 02:01:36,279
Take all of their heads! Burn
their houses to the ground!

1063
02:01:36,480 --> 02:01:40,399
Attack!

1064
02:01:46,160 --> 02:01:51,199
Archers, get in position!
Soldiers, defend the people quickly!

1065
02:01:51,320 --> 02:01:55,799
Ignite the beacons!

1066
02:02:15,000 --> 02:02:20,719
Everyone who stand behind
Osman will burn in my flame!

1067
02:02:20,840 --> 02:02:23,439
This tribe will be your grave, mongol!

1068
02:02:23,520 --> 02:02:28,839
This and other tribes will be
slain by mongols' mighty swords!

1069
02:02:29,040 --> 02:02:33,679
Attack on the tribes has already
started! I am your destiny now!

1070
02:02:50,520 --> 02:02:55,719
-Battering ram is ready, my bey.
-Okay.

1071
02:03:00,200 --> 02:03:03,679
-Konur.
-Yes, my bey.

1072
02:03:03,800 --> 02:03:09,199
You will lead the siege. You
will climb the walls with ladders.

1073
02:03:09,480 --> 02:03:12,319
Boran, alps and me.

1074
02:03:12,560 --> 02:03:16,559
We will ram the backdoor.

1075
02:03:16,840 --> 02:03:21,799
-With the battering ram.
-As you command, my bey.

1076
02:03:38,720 --> 02:03:44,079
It's from my patrols. Mongol
dastards attacked Uraz Bey's tribe.

1077
02:03:44,360 --> 02:03:49,959
Patrols tried to stop them, but...

1078
02:04:04,760 --> 02:04:09,879
No one but us will help us.

1079
02:04:11,200 --> 02:04:15,279
Take the siege equipment to the forest.

1080
02:04:16,320 --> 02:04:19,719
We will go to the tribe.

1081
02:04:32,800 --> 02:04:36,359
You forgot about us while Osman was here.

1082
02:04:36,640 --> 02:04:40,559
Now Ilkhanids are here, where is Osman?

1083
02:04:41,120 --> 02:04:44,399
-You will be ruined.
-Osman Bey is not here!

1084
02:04:44,480 --> 02:04:47,919
But brave soldiers of Turks are here!

1085
02:04:57,200 --> 02:05:01,839
The fate of death was
written when my brother died.

1086
02:05:01,920 --> 02:05:06,439
I'll ruin your houses. You will bend the knee.

1087
02:05:06,880 --> 02:05:11,799
You will die.
-Never!

1088
02:05:36,000 --> 02:05:42,599
Yenisehir is not even the size
of Ilkhanid's hunting ground.

1089
02:05:42,720 --> 02:05:47,799
This is a rebellion against the God of Death.

1090
02:05:47,880 --> 02:05:54,599
Osman, both you and your city will be ruined!

1091
02:05:54,840 --> 02:06:00,199
Braveheart nokers of Ilkhanids.

1092
02:06:00,280 --> 02:06:04,639
You fought by my side in China,

1093
02:06:04,800 --> 02:06:10,439
in the mountain of Tengri.

1094
02:06:10,600 --> 02:06:15,039
You captured their treasures and castles!

1095
02:06:15,800 --> 02:06:19,999
Now we will teach these lands

1096
02:06:20,080 --> 02:06:24,119
the glory of nokers

1097
02:06:24,200 --> 02:06:28,279
and strength of Ilkhanids! We will destroy

1098
02:06:28,360 --> 02:06:33,799
the capital city of Osman
who captured the princess.

1099
02:06:34,120 --> 02:06:38,639
Their women and their children

1100
02:06:38,920 --> 02:06:42,359
will be ruined!

1101
02:06:54,120 --> 02:06:57,079
Emir Gorklu Khan, Osman set out for the tribe.

1102
02:06:57,160 --> 02:07:00,159
Great. Let him go to his tribe.

1103
02:07:00,280 --> 02:07:04,359
Get ready. We're starting.

1104
02:07:04,440 --> 02:07:07,319
The city is very well protected.

1105
02:07:07,400 --> 02:07:10,959
-How are you going to enter?
-First,

1106
02:07:11,400 --> 02:07:14,199
you will disguise as them.

1107
02:07:14,280 --> 02:07:18,199
I'll attack with my nokers

1108
02:07:18,280 --> 02:07:21,959
when the adhan sounds. The rest is blood

1109
02:07:22,040 --> 02:07:26,239
the rest is doomsday!

1110
02:07:42,720 --> 02:07:46,479
-Brother, don't!
-Let go off me Gonca!

1111
02:07:50,600 --> 02:07:55,679
Brother, stop. Alaeddin!

1112
02:08:00,880 --> 02:08:05,719
Brother, stop. Brother, stop. Please don't.

1113
02:08:05,800 --> 02:08:08,959
-For Allah's sake, don't.
-Let go off me Gonca!

1114
02:08:09,040 --> 02:08:12,559
I'll talk to you later.

1115
02:08:12,640 --> 02:08:16,479
Do not say anything to her.
Tell me what you have to say.

1116
02:08:16,600 --> 02:08:20,639
Who are you to try to protect my sister?

1117
02:08:20,720 --> 02:08:24,279
Alaeddin, please.

1118
02:08:30,320 --> 02:08:34,039
Alaeddin, no. Brother, for Allah's sake.

1119
02:08:34,120 --> 02:08:37,159
I'm in love with your sister, Mehmed Bey.

1120
02:08:37,360 --> 02:08:40,359
It is my responsibility to protect her life.

1121
02:08:40,480 --> 02:08:44,239
Alaeddin! Brother!

1122
02:08:45,760 --> 02:08:47,119
Alaeddin, please stop.

1123
02:08:47,200 --> 02:08:49,879
-Brother, no!
-Move away, Gonca!

1124
02:08:49,960 --> 02:08:52,559
I'll not see you around my sister, Alaeddin!

1125
02:08:52,640 --> 02:08:55,799
Just calm down.
Just listen to me.

1126
02:08:56,040 --> 02:09:00,399
-Gonca! Move away, Gonca!
-No!

1127
02:09:02,920 --> 02:09:07,559
No! Brother! Brother! Alaeddin.

1128
02:09:07,760 --> 02:09:12,639
Brother, stop. Brother, stop.

1129
02:09:12,800 --> 02:09:15,839
-Alps, help me! -Gokmen! Arrest them!

1130
02:09:15,960 --> 02:09:20,479
No! No! No! Alaeddin, no.

1131
02:09:20,600 --> 02:09:24,159
-Stop it, Mehmed Bey!
-Hold Gonca!

1132
02:09:24,240 --> 02:09:27,519
Brother! no!

1133
02:09:27,600 --> 02:09:32,079
-Don't do it, Mehmed Bey.
-I said no, brother!

1134
02:09:32,920 --> 02:09:35,599
Who's going to save you from me now, Alaeddin?

1135
02:09:35,680 --> 02:09:40,559
You're testing my patience,
Mehmed Bey. Let Gonca go.

1136
02:09:42,360 --> 02:09:45,159
Your problem is with me.

1137
02:09:45,520 --> 02:09:54,039
Brother, please stop it! Stop it! Alaeddin!

1138
02:09:54,320 --> 02:10:00,279
Brother, please. Brother, what are you doing?

1139
02:10:00,400 --> 02:10:03,159
-Brother, please!
-No.

1140
02:10:03,400 --> 02:10:07,879
I've told you many times that you will
change your path when you see Alaeddin.

1141
02:10:10,880 --> 02:10:14,159
-Brother, stop!
-You wanted this, Gonca.

1142
02:10:14,240 --> 02:10:17,119
Alaeddin! Brother!

1143
02:10:20,240 --> 02:10:25,039
Let go off me! Alaeddin!

1144
02:10:28,080 --> 02:10:31,199
You spilled the blood of my alps and people

1145
02:10:31,400 --> 02:10:35,839
-you will pay for this!
-I don't pay price.

1146
02:10:42,000 --> 02:10:45,919
I burned down their tribes
and I ruined their cities.

1147
02:10:46,040 --> 02:10:49,639
I didn't even leave a child who can seek revenge!

1148
02:10:49,840 --> 02:10:53,719
I will make you pay for this!

1149
02:10:53,880 --> 02:10:57,519
No, now you will die.

1150
02:11:12,760 --> 02:11:15,199
Osman Bey.

1151
02:11:18,880 --> 02:11:23,439
Osman, I've been waiting for you.

1152
02:11:30,560 --> 02:11:34,199
You will not be able to
invade Turks' independence!

1153
02:11:34,280 --> 02:11:38,839
-Ya Allah!
-Allah!

1154
02:12:31,560 --> 02:12:35,679
Our men have stood against the
oppressors! Kill them with your swords...

1155
02:12:35,800 --> 02:12:39,439
...until we defeat all the demons, my valiants!

1156
02:12:39,520 --> 02:12:47,399
Alps! Today, death will not find
us but it will find them! Come on!

1157
02:12:59,320 --> 02:13:01,999
-Peace be upon you!
-Peace be upon you too!

1158
02:13:02,080 --> 02:13:05,279
What is in the cart?
-Clothes.

1159
02:13:05,440 --> 02:13:08,759
Let us see.

1160
02:13:32,160 --> 02:13:35,799
Alright, you can go. -Thank you.

1161
02:14:28,400 --> 02:14:31,559
It is time, get ready.

1162
02:14:53,320 --> 02:14:56,679
Gorklu Khan will bring
death to this city, come on!

1163
02:16:18,680 --> 02:16:22,319
Run!

1164
02:16:43,360 --> 02:16:45,798
Mother!

1165
02:16:47,040 --> 02:16:50,839
Take the elderly and children to
places where they can take shelter!

1166
02:16:50,840 --> 02:16:57,519
Do not let them enter the
palace! Inform Malhun! Come on!

1167
02:17:15,240 --> 02:17:18,519
Kill everyone on whom...

1168
02:17:18,638 --> 02:17:21,798
...Osman's shadow falls!

1169
02:17:22,000 --> 02:17:26,159
We will bring the doomsday here today!

1170
02:17:26,320 --> 02:17:29,558
Attack!

1171
02:17:32,879 --> 02:17:35,718
Fatma... Go back to the palace.

1172
02:17:35,879 --> 02:17:41,119
My homeland is raided, mother.
You are telling me to go back.

1173
02:17:41,200 --> 02:17:43,999
I can fight with a sword.

1174
02:17:44,120 --> 02:17:47,359
Good. Stay behind me.

1175
02:17:48,840 --> 02:17:52,638
We can give our lives, but never
the lands we took with martyrs' blood!

1176
02:17:52,799 --> 02:17:56,317
Alps! Come on!

1177
02:18:01,480 --> 02:18:07,798
Alps! We will stop Mongols
before they approach the palace.

1178
02:18:08,360 --> 02:18:12,239
Gorkem! Make a defense wall in the streets.

1179
02:18:12,360 --> 02:18:14,718
Position archers on the top, come on!

1180
02:18:14,799 --> 02:18:20,279
Yes, Baysungur Alp!
-Come on! Hurry!

1181
02:18:22,680 --> 02:18:25,272
Baysungur Alp. The
people are taking refuge in

1182
02:18:25,285 --> 02:18:27,999
shelters. The Mongols
have seized the marketplace.

1183
02:18:28,040 --> 02:18:31,558
That is not good.
That is not good.

1184
02:18:31,718 --> 02:18:36,239
Inform our Alps. Tell them to retreat,
fighting all the way back to the defense line.

1185
02:18:36,320 --> 02:18:43,759
Come on! Alps! Listen to me! Come here!

1186
02:18:45,879 --> 02:18:51,159
Today, with Allah's consent,
we will not let Mongols pass.

1187
02:18:51,360 --> 02:18:56,397
Once they reach the defense line, we
will attack and destroy them If Allah permits

1188
02:18:56,558 --> 02:19:00,558
Come on! Now everyone go back to their duties!

1189
02:19:00,638 --> 02:19:05,519
Baysungur! What happened? What is the situation?

1190
02:19:06,120 --> 02:19:10,159
Mongols... They sneaked in the
city under the guise of our people.

1191
02:19:10,280 --> 02:19:13,477
-What?
-They are coming here fast.

1192
02:19:15,558 --> 02:19:21,199
First... first, our people.
Their safety will be ensured.

1193
02:19:21,480 --> 02:19:24,519
Ulgen. Fulfill all of our
Alps' and Sisters' needs.

1194
02:19:24,638 --> 02:19:27,199
Bring the injured ones here. And inform Fatma.

1195
02:19:27,280 --> 02:19:31,439
Malhun Hatun... Fatma is
at the marketplace with Bala.

1196
02:19:31,558 --> 02:19:34,079
What are you saying, Ulgen?

1197
02:19:37,040 --> 02:19:40,447
Alps! Sisters! We are
going to the marketplace!

1198
02:19:40,459 --> 02:19:41,599
Malhun Hatun!

1199
02:19:41,879 --> 02:19:44,798
The marketplace has fallen.

1200
02:19:47,120 --> 02:19:50,079
They surrounded it from all sides.

1201
02:19:52,320 --> 02:19:55,037
My Allah...
-Malhun Hatun..

1202
02:19:55,049 --> 02:19:58,719
My Allah, protect
them.. Protect them.

1203
02:20:20,960 --> 02:20:23,759
Come here!

1204
02:21:21,480 --> 02:21:25,759
Allah is the Greatest! Allah is the Greatest!

1205
02:21:53,120 --> 02:21:53,799
You thoughtyou Would be
saved after taking the Princess

1206
02:21:53,800 --> 02:21:56,599
You thought you would be
saved after taking the Princess.

1207
02:21:56,680 --> 02:21:59,639
But disaster is raining on your lands.

1208
02:21:59,720 --> 02:22:03,759
These lands were taken with
blood! And they are kept with blood!

1209
02:22:09,040 --> 02:22:16,359
How will you save them Osman?
Your tribes and cities are destroyed!

1210
02:22:16,440 --> 02:22:20,799
Alps will arrive! Cities will
be built! But independence...

1211
02:22:21,080 --> 02:22:25,399
...independence is the legacy of Turks!

1212
02:22:25,880 --> 02:22:29,279
This tribe will be your hell, Osman!

1213
02:22:29,600 --> 02:22:32,399
You will find independence after you die!

1214
02:22:32,640 --> 02:22:38,879
Whether we stand united or are left
alone, we will never give up these lands!

1215
02:22:38,960 --> 02:22:41,959
Ya Allah!

1216
02:24:08,120 --> 02:24:11,959
I swear, I swear..

1217
